ew product</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I am always among the first to prescribe a new product</text></labels><versions><version name="4"><category name="first"/></version></versions></category><category id="_1cc184ad-035d-4f3b-b93d-096c3c120132" name="waitShort"><labels context="LABEL"><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="4" Index="0"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I like to wait a while (for a few months) after a new product is approved before I start prescribing it</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I like to wait a while (for a few months) after a new product is approved before I start prescribing it</text></labels><versions><version name="4"><category name="waitShort"/></version></versions></category><category id="_ab123742-4787-4b77-840b-70eb327dd569" name="waitMedium"><labels context="LABEL"><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="4" Index="0"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I wait to be comfortable (for more than a few months) with a new product by speaking to colleagues, hearing about its success before I prescribe it</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I wait to be comfortable (for more than a few months) with a new product by speaking to colleagues, hearing about its success before I prescribe it</text></labels><versions><version name="4"><category name="waitMedium"/></version></versions></category><category id="_95ad1d83-77e1-45ac-b5cb-fdb019049cd9" name="waitLong"><labels context="LABEL"><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="4" Index="0"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I prefer to prescribe products that are tried and trusted</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">I prefer to prescribe products that are tried and trusted</text></labels><versions><version name="4"><category name="waitLong"/></version></versions></category><category id="_ee5f8f61-4d35-4df4-a561-0a204259837f" name="reluctant"><labels context="LABEL"><version