><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Healthcare runs a side by side layout where questions are shown to the left of response controls.  This works because completion is often on desktop.  It may be that certain pages place whole questions side by side, this limits horizontal space and so the layout must be responsive and collapse to a vertical layout when there is insufficient space</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Healthcare runs a side by side layout where questions are shown to the left of response controls.  This works because completion is often on desktop.  It may be that certain pages place whole questions side by side, this limits horizontal space and so the layout must be responsive and collapse to a vertical layout when there is insufficient space</text></labels><versions><version name="34"><variable name="sidebysidelayout" type="0"/></version></versions></variable><variable id="78336a66-a03a-4c42-89b2-2df872b54c32" name="WhichQuestion" type="3" max="1" maxtype="3" min="1" mintype="3"><templates><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="34" Index="0"><property name="Question" value="question 2-column.htm" type="8" context="Question"/></DIFF><DIFF OP="DEL" name="41" Index="0"/><DIFF OP="ADD" name="41" Index="0"><property name="Question" value="question 2-column information top right.htm" type="8" context="Question"/></DIFF></versions><property name="Question" value="question 2-column information top right.htm" type="8" context="Question"/></templates><labels context="LABEL"><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="34" Index="0"><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Is your survey patient or doctor orientated</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Is your survey patient or doctor orientated</text></labels><categories global-name-space="-1"><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="34" Index="0" item="b15331e1-bfe7-4c74-8752-0494fef89966"/><DIFF OP="ADD" name="34" Index="1" item="4f4ad124-4803-4cb7-8718-5de061d5ad28"/><ve