mbedded in the html for screen readers to pickup&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Images in Question text&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Images can be placed around the question's text either above or below, to the left or the right. It is also possible to embed images directly within the html of the survey&lt;/p&gt;</text></DIFF></versions><text context="QUESTION" xml:lang="en-US">Images can be placed witin any question.&lt;p&gt;Images are accessiblity sensitive they must have a caption / alt text that accurately describes the image for those who are visually impaired.  this can either be visible as a caption for the image or can be embedded in the html for screen readers to pickup&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Images in Question text&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Images can be placed around the question's text either above or below, to the left or the right. It is also possible to embed images directly within the html of the survey&lt;/p&gt;</text></labels><versions><version name="82"><variable name="ImageInstructions" type="0"/></version></versions></variable><variable id="7b583c5c-cd7a-4d74-be49-1dc94b60be13" name="ImageInQuestionBelow" type="0"><properties><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="82" Index="0"><property name="CurrentTab" value="ImageInQuestion" type="8" context="Question"/></DIFF></versions><property name="CurrentTab" value="ImageInQuestion" type="8" context="Question"/></properties><styles><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="82" Index="0"><property name="BgColor" value="information:" type="8" context="Question"/></DIFF></versions><property name="BgColor" value="information:" type="8" context="Question"/></styles><labelstyles><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="82" Index="0"><property name="ImageObj" type="9" context="Question"><labelstyles><versions><DIFF OP="ADD" name="82" Index="0"><property name="Width" value="1200" type="8" context="Question"/></DIFF><DIFF OP="ADD" name="82" Index="1"><property name="Height" value="675" type="8" context="Question"/></DIFF><DIFF OP="ADD" name="82" Index="2"><property name="